  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Minor Physical Mutation</strong></p>\n<p>A gemstone grows in your body, protruding through your flesh like an unholy jewel.  The crystal is attuned to the Winds of Magic (much like @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.OEjUvJKi0xmBwbS2]{Second Sight}) and will change colour and intensity depending on which winds are prevailing in the environment. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.6w30u0VPsAicrqb5]{Magical Sense} Talent, although you have to be able to see how your crystal behaves in order for it to work. Being near or touching a magic-user will make the gemstone glow brighter in their chosen Wind. You also gain the @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.g3y373FnWJEAxgEB]{Detect Artefact} Talent. Nearing a magical item will make your crystal glow stronger and by touching it you may try to determine its powers. Unfortunately the crystal functions as a conduit for magic and you have -10 to all <b>Opposed Tests</b> versus incoming spells. You can only gain this mutation once.</p>"
    },
